  "description": "The TX14 dataset comprises EEG recordings collected during a local situational awareness task performed while maintaining supervisory control of a semi-autonomous vehicle. This dataset investigates the cognitive and attentional demands of human-machine interaction in military contexts, specifically examining the trade-offs between monitoring local area awareness and vehicle control during semi-autonomous operations. The data supports research into dynamic task allocation and human factors in supervisory control systems.",
